'''Pikachu's Short Stories''' (Japanese: '''ピカチュウ短編集''' ''Pikachu's Short Stories'') is a graphic novel retelling the plotlines of various [[Pikachu short]]s.

Volume 1 by [[Chuang Yi]] tells the story of [[PK01]], [[PK04]] and [[PK07]]. Volume 2 by Chuang Yi tells the story of [[PK10]], [[PK11]] and [[PK12]].

